      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BLUE STORM (6) jumped from a squeeze box last start but was quickly into stride and led throughout to score (34.38) at The Meadows in a Grade 4/5 over 600m. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Well placed and can measure up. ASCEND GERANIUM (8) could not have been more impressive last start in his fast 30.98 win at Ballarat in a Grade 5 over 545m. Rates a leading chance if runs up to latest. REGAL JYLE (1) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing fifth (30.25) in a Grade 5 at this track. Form at the trip sound including three wins. Has a win and two minor placings from three starts from this draw. Can figure in the finish. KEEN ON KEV (2) should bounce back after an unplaced effort here recently.",
